          "covered": true,
          "mechanic_id": "calibrum_attack_range",
          "reason": "States the range benefit with its main-hand condition."
        },
        {
          "answer_quote": "Calibrum hits through abilities mark enemies for a long-range follow-up with the off-hand weapon, or the main-hand weapon if Calibrum is off-hand. The follow-up consumes all marks and adds physical damage for each mark consumed.",
          "covered": true,
          "mechanic_id": "calibrum_marks",
          "reason": "Explains mark creation, weapon dependencies, consumption and bonus damage."
